# requirements.txt

Follow `docs/규칙.md`.

- Add new packages only by **appending** `name==version` at the **bottom** of `requirements.txt`.
- Do **not** insert in the middle or re-sort A-Z.
- Do **not** run `pip freeze > requirements.txt` (overwrites whole file).
- Bump an existing package by editing **that line only**; do not move it.
- Pin with `==`. No personal/dev-only packages in the shared file.
